('deity.japanese.tamayorihime_kamo','Tamayorihime (Kamo tradition)','玉依姬（贺茂传统）','玉依毘売命','Tamayorihime','DEITY','civ.japanese_shinto','region.east_asia','Fragmentary Yamashiro Fudoki genealogy','贺茂谱系中的玉依姬；“玉依姬”也可指其他人物，因此使用限定实体。 / Kamo-genealogy Tamayorihime; the title/name can denote other figures, so this record is scoped.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"homonym_scope":"Kamo tradition; daughter of Kamo Taketsunumi"}','2026-08-23T00:00:00Z','2026-08-23T00:00:00Z'),
