('deity.japanese.honoikazuchi_otokuni','Honoikazuchi (Otokuni tradition)','火雷神（乙训传统）','火雷神','Honoikazuchi no Kami','DEITY','civ.japanese_shinto','region.east_asia','Fragmentary Yamashiro Fudoki, Otokuni context','学术条目所述乙训郡火雷神／红箭谱系人物；不与《古事记》黄泉八雷中的火雷自动合并。 / Honoikazuchi of the Otokuni red-arrow genealogy; not automatically merged with the Kojiki Yomi thunder kami.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"identity_caution":"relationship to Kojiki Honoikazuchi unresolved"}','2026-08-23T00:00:00Z','2026-08-23T00:00:00Z'),
