('festival.japan.kamo_aoi','Kamo Festival (Aoi Matsuri)','贺茂祭（葵祭）','賀茂祭','Kamo-sai / Aoi Matsuri','FESTIVAL','civ.japanese_shinto','region.east_asia','Living annual festival with layered historical tradition','京都持续举行的公开节庆与仪式传统；神社所述起源、历史制度和现代行列分层保存。 / Continuing Kyoto festival whose shrine-origin narrative, historical institutions and modern procession remain layered.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"living_tradition":true,"public_scope_only":true}','2026-08-23T00:00:00Z','2026-08-23T00:00:00Z'),
