('claim.v0100.tamayori_parent_kamo','deity.japanese.tamayorihime_kamo','PARENT_OF','deity.japanese.kamo_wakeikazuchi',NULL,NULL,'Kokugakuin reports the fragmentary Yamashiro genealogy in which Tamayorihime is mother of Kamo Wakeikazuchi.','japan.kamo.fragmentary_genealogy','SUPPORTED',0.96,'HIGH','VERIFIED','SCHOLARLY_INTERPRETATION','TEXTUAL_WITNESS','Fragmentary Yamashiro no kuni fudoki genealogy','Fragmentary provincial-gazetteer tradition','The surviving fragment is accessed through modern academic reference, not presented as a complete manuscript.','2026-08-23T00:00:00Z'),
('claim.v0100.taketsunumi_parent_tamayori','deity.japanese.kamo_taketsunumi','PARENT_OF','deity.japanese.tamayorihime_kamo',NULL,NULL,'The academic entry identifies Kamo Taketsunumi as father of Tamayorihime in the Kamo genealogy.','japan.kamo.fragmentary_genealogy','SUPPORTED',0.96,'HIGH','VERIFIED','SCHOLARLY_INTERPRETATION','TEXTUAL_WITNESS','Fragmentary Yamashiro no kuni fudoki genealogy','Fragmentary provincial-gazetteer tradition',NULL,'2026-08-23T00:00:00Z'),
('claim.v0100.hono_parent_kamo','deity.japanese.honoikazuchi_otokuni','PARENT_OF','deity.japanese.kamo_wakeikazuchi',NULL,NULL,'Kokugakuin reports that the red arrow in the fragmentary genealogy is a transformation of Honoikazuchi of Otokuni and fathers Kamo Wakeikazuchi.','japan.kamo.fragmentary_genealogy','SUPPORTED',0.92,'HIGH','VERIFIED','SCHOLARLY_INTERPRETATION','TEXTUAL_WITNESS','Fragmentary Yamashiro no kuni fudoki genealogy','Fragmentary provincial-gazetteer tradition','The scoped Otokuni entity prevents an unsupported merger with the Kojiki Yomi Honoikazuchi.','2026-08-23T00:00:00Z'),
